# Llama 3 70B on 4 nodes of 8 GPUs, as tp_70b.bux trains it but with a pipeline across
# the nodes in place of FSDP: each node holds 20 of the 80 blocks, in two rounds of 10
# (a circular pipeline), and a step's 256 rows go through in 16 microbatches. A stage
# idles for (S - 1) / (R·M + S - 1) = 3 / 35 of a step; `bux plan` shows it.
#
#   bux plan   examples/experiments/parallel/pp_70b.bux
#   bux launch examples/experiments/parallel/pp_70b.bux     # on every host
#
# Every host runs the same command; docs/training.md says how they find each other.
use llama3_70b
use fineweb_wsd

mesh      = mesh(stage=4, tensor=8)
layout    = layout(stream=tensor)
precision = precision(compute=bfloat16)
methods   = methods(repeat=scan, remat=full, pipeline=circular, rounds=2,
                    microbatches=16)
optimizer.lr = 1.5e-4
